  "question": {
    "text": "Which method of purification is represented by the following equation:\n$\\mathrm{Ti}(\\mathrm{s})+2 \\mathrm{I}_2(\\mathrm{g}) \\stackrel{523 \\mathrm{~K}}{\\longrightarrow} \\mathrm{TiI}_4(\\mathrm{g}) \\stackrel{1700 \\mathrm{~K}}{\\longrightarrow} \\mathrm{Ti}(\\mathrm{s})+2 \\mathrm{I}_2(\\mathrm{g})$"
